+A local-first Rails app for preparing and playing live conference quizzes.
+
+Create or import a quiz in the moderator area, then choose **Start a game**. Share the on-screen link or QR code with players. Use **Start**, **Finish**, **Next**, and **End quiz** to run the talk; phones and the big screen update automatically. Every new game has independent players and answers.
 
